/>exp:01(200683280:3H.@past,     102326432:01.@def)<br />cnt:01(200683280:3H.@past,     :03)<br />aoj:03(301823092:29,     106729499:1H.@def)<br />man:03(impossible:29,     simply:51)<br />agt:03(assertion:1H.@def,     tortoise:78.@def)<br />agt:02(200804139:0L.@past,     hare:02.@def)<br />cnt:02(200804139:0L.@past,     107162194:42.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406279]<br />{org:en}<br />They agreed that the Fox should choose the course and fix the goal.<br />{/org}<br />{or}<br />ସେମାନେ ସହମତ ହେଲେ ଯେ କୋକିଶିଆଳୀ ମାର୍ଗ ବାଛିବ ଏବଂ ଲକ୍ଷ୍ୟସ୍ଥଳ ସ୍ଥିର କରିବ<br />{/or}<br />{or}<br />ସେମାନେ ସହମତ ହେଲେ ଯେ କୋକିଶିଆଳୀ ଲକ୍ଷ୍ୟସ୍ଥଳ ସ୍ଥିର କରିବ ଏବଂ ମାର୍ଗ ବାଛିବ<br />{/or}<br />{unl}<br />exp(agree.@past,     00.@3.@pl)<br />obj(agree.@past,     :01)<br />agt:01(:02.@decision,     fox.@def)<br />and:02(choose,     fix)<br />cnt:02(choose,     course.@def)<br />cnt:02(fix,     goal.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406280]<br />{org:en}<br />On the day appointed for the race the Hare and the Tortoise started together.<br />{/org}<br />{or}<br />ଦୌଡ଼ ପାଇଁ ନିର୍ଦ୍ଧାରିତ ଦିନରେ ଠେକୁଆ ଓ କଇଁଛ ଏକସଙ୍ଗେ ଆରମ୍ଭ କଲେ<br />{/or}<br />{or}<br />ଦୌଡ଼ ପାଇଁ ନିର୍ଦ୍ଧାରିତ ଦିନ ଠେକୁଆ ଓ କଇଁଛ ଏକସଙ୍ଗେ ଆରମ୍ଭ କଲେ<br />{/or}<br />{unl}<br />agt(start.@past,     :01)<br />tim(start.@past,     :02)<br />and:01(hare.@def,     tortoise.@def)<br />man(start.@past,     together)<br />cnt:02(appoint.@past,     day.@def.@topic)<br />pur:02(appoint.@past,     race.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406281]<br />{org:en}<br />The Tortoise did not stop.<br />{/org}<br />{or}<br />କଇଁଛ ଅଟକିଲା ନାହିଁ<br />{/or}<br />{unl}<br />agt(stop.@past.@not,     tortoise.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:406282]<br />{org:en}<br />The Tortoise went on with a slow but steady pace straight to the end of the course.<br />{/org}<br />{or}<br />କଇଁଛ ଧୀର କିନ୍ତୁ ସ୍ଥିର ଗତିରେ ସିଧା ମାର୍ଗର ଶେଷ ପର୍ଯ୍ୟନ୍ତ ଚାଲିଲା<br />{/or}<br />{unl}<br />agt(go on.@past,     tortoise.@def)<br />met(go on.@past,     pace.@indef.@with)<br /